# Trivy IaC exceptions (documented, reviewed).

# AWS-0104: unrestricted security-group egress.
# The Lambda/RDS-Proxy/DB security groups allow outbound because the Lambda must
# reach AWS service endpoints (Secrets Manager, STS, KMS, CloudWatch Logs via
# interface endpoints, and DynamoDB via the gateway endpoint's managed prefix
# list), plus optional third-party egress when the static-egress-IP flag is on.
# All these SGs are egress-only and attached to resources in private subnets
# with no inbound path from the internet. Tighten to your exact destinations if
# your threat model requires it (see docs/security).
AWS-0104
